      "message": "I have a Docking test where I can use the servoV4.1 in DP mode to send Attention messages at different intervals. Our stacks seem to function well at approx. 5ms but not lower. I tested this CL and it didn\u0027t have an impact; 5ms seems to be the lower limit. Even changing the loop time from 5ms to 2ms didn\u0027t make a difference.\nI also tested the TCPMv1 stack and it too could not keep up with receiving messages at an interval less than 5ms. Please see this bug for details https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/155517411. It describes my test and all logs and Total Phase traces can be accessed.",
